<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41688" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-χρώννῡμι</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-ύω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-χρώσω</span>: pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κέχρωκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
				</span></i>
			(v.infr.) : —<i>rub</i> or <i>smear over, colour
				on the surface, tinge,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Anat.</u>
				30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.395e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				4.5.7
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span> with a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Dom.</u>
				8
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἄχρι τοῦ ἐπικεχρῶσθαι μόνον,
					ἀλλ᾽ ἐς βάθος.. φαρμάκοις.. καταβαφεῖσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Im.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			 : metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴ ἐπακτὸν νοῦν ἔχει -χρωννύντα
					αὐτήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					5.6.4
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξαις ἐπικεχρωσμένοι</span>
			<i>merely tinged</i> with.., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				340d
			</span></i>.</div>
